{
  "bookId": "hero-212207",
  "id": "bond-35310",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35310001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这鸡蛋壳上的花纹看起来比之前的几个要复杂许多……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35310002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "如你所见，我正在尝试新的设计。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35310003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "在一碰就碎的鸡蛋壳上也能雕刻出如此精美绝伦的纹路。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35310004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "尽管看到过很多次了，还是会被塞西尔高超的微雕技艺所折服。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35310005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "手办化后，这种程度的微雕对我来说并没有什么难度。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35310006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "但这些，也只是没有灵魂的工艺品而已。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35310007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "塞西尔的作品都很美啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35310008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "你认为生命和艺术的关系是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35310010",
              "text": "突然问这么哲学的问题吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "35310010",
              "text": "好难回答……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35310009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35310010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "不急，我们有足够的时间去讨论这个问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35310011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "好了，这次的作品已经完成了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35310013",
              "text": "你雕刻的这个人，看起来……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35310012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35310013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "是你。你的存在确实给了我一些不错的灵感。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "35310",
